  "description": "<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"24df0f63-3c44-4d8c-9a1f-09b4da7203f2\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-2\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"50\" data-end=\"456\">De <strong data-start=\"53\" data-end=\"71\">Polar Ignite 1</strong> is een lichte en gebruiksvriendelijke <strong data-start=\"110\" data-end=\"124\">smartwatch</strong>, gericht op sport, training en gezondheid. Dit model is ideaal voor zowel beginnende als ervaren sporters die inzicht willen in hun activiteiten, conditie en herstel. Met functies zoals hartslagmeting, slaaptracking en begeleide trainingen helpt de Polar Ignite je om doelgericht en verantwoord te trainen, zowel binnen als buiten.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"458\" data-end=\"541\">Dit betreft een <strong data-start=\"474\" data-end=\"494\">gebruikt product</strong> en het horloge verkeert in <strong data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"540\">In Nette Staat</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"543\" data-end=\"546\">\r\n<p data-start=\"548\" data-end=\"563\">⭐ <strong data-start=\"550\" data-end=\"563\">Voordelen</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"798\">\r\n<li data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"620\">\r\n<p data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"620\">⌚ Licht en comfortabel design voor dagelijks gebruik</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"621\" data-end=\"654\">\r\n<p data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"654\">❤️ Hartslagmeting via de pols</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"698\">\r\n<p data-start=\"657\" data-end=\"698\">💤 Uitgebreide slaap- en herstelanalyse</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"749\">\r\n<p data-start=\"701\" data-end=\"749\">🏃 Geschikt voor diverse sporten en trainingen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"750\" data-end=\"798\">\r\n<p data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"798\">🔋 Goede batterijduur voor dagelijks gebruik</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"803\">\r\n<p data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"825\">📋 <strong data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"825\">Specificaties</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"826\" data-end=\"1117\">\r\n<li data-start=\"826\" data-end=\"841\">\r\n<p data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"841\">Merk: Polar</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"842\" data-end=\"861\">\r\n<p data-start=\"844\" data-end=\"861\">Model: Ignite 1</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"862\" data-end=\"882\">\r\n<p data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"882\">Type: Smartwatch</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"883\" data-end=\"914\">\r\n<p data-start=\"885\" data-end=\"914\">Display: Kleurentouchscreen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"968\">\r\n<p data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"968\">Gezondheidssensoren: Hartslagmeter, slaaptracking</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"969\" data-end=\"1021\">\r\n<p data-start=\"971\" data-end=\"1021\">Sportfuncties: Hardlopen, fitness, zwemmen, meer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1022\" data-end=\"1056\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1056\">Connectiviteit: Bluetooth, GPS</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1091\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1091\">Compatibiliteit: Android & iOS</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1092\" data-end=\"1117\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1117\">Staat: In Nette Staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1122\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1124\" data-end=\"1142\">📦 <strong data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1142\">Meegeleverd</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1188\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1172\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1172\">Polar Ignite 1 smartwatch</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1188\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1188\">Oplaadkabel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1193\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1195\" data-end=\"1258\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">🛡️ <strong data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1217\">Incl. Garantie</strong><br data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1220\">Incl. Garantie: <strong data-start=\"1236\" data-end=\"1258\" data-is-last-node=\"\">3 maanden garantie</strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"border-token-border-light my-2 flex gap-10 border-t pt-4\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden h-12 w-12 rounded-lg\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>",
